{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55614","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十二 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"言行相应宜此地，空谈大隐也无端。\n昇沈歧路非他得，生熟根机且自看。\n瞋火微烟还渐息，贪泉余润亦消乾。\n平生正直须甘取，虚幻门中莫自瞒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55614.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55614","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}